## 1. Lazy loading images and iframes

```html
<!-- Browser defers download until image is near the viewport -->
<img src="article-photo.jpg" alt="..." loading="lazy" />
<iframe src="https://maps.example.com" loading="lazy" title="Map"></iframe>

<!-- Eagerly load above-the-fold images -->
<img src="hero.jpg" alt="Hero" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
```

## 2. Critical CSS inline

```html
