## 3. Resource hints

```html
<head>
  <!-- Preload: high-priority resource needed soon -->
  <link rel="preload" href="/fonts/inter.woff2" as="font" crossorigin />

  <!-- Prefetch: resource needed for the next navigation -->
  <link rel="prefetch" href="/questions/react" />

  <!-- DNS prefetch: resolve third-party domains early -->
  <link rel="dns-prefetch" href="https://analytics.example.com" />

  <!-- Preconnect: DNS + TCP + TLS handshake early -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
</head>
```

