## Comparison table

| Feature | localStorage | sessionStorage | IndexedDB |
|---|---|---|---|
| Capacity | ~5 MB | ~5 MB | Gigabytes |
| Data types | Strings only | Strings only | Any structured |
| Async | No (sync) | No (sync) | Yes |
| Indexes | No | No | Yes |
| Transactions | No | No | Yes |
| Workers | No | No | Yes |
| Use case | Preferences | Tab state | Offline apps, cache |

## Service Worker + IndexedDB (offline caching)

```js
// Cache API responses in IndexedDB for offline use
self.addEventListener('fetch', async (e) => {
  const cached = await db.cache.get(e.request.url);
  if (cached) return new Response(cached.body);
  const response = await fetch(e.request);
  await db.cache.put({ url: e.request.url, body: await response.text() });
  return response;
});
```

